description: Mandatory Memora rules for every Cursor agent
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md`, `.agent/workflow.md`, the active `specs/SLICE_NN.md`, and only the role-specific context named by the orchestrator before editing.

Use fictional data only. Never add real patient, caregiver, family, health, contact or location data. Never add secrets or production credentials.

Do not make medical claims. Memora is supportive software, not a treatment, diagnostic tool or emergency service.

Do not introduce LLM or generative-AI features in v0.1. Do not invent product requirements. Keep changes inside the active slice and your role’s allowed paths.

Never push, rewrite Git history, bypass the orchestrator or start another slice.
